# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 2e3401741eb6ab77220db31920f18139f45fde19409fba765608929658524258
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 0bc06b70ec826d01da17570bff7d7752b49c167e6ac724a80bee042c75e80a16
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 79244b0d3f1bb5e0a58a0335034e9a63166708c040470db4204d826679db2fec
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock a95873b7fd91b7b34ad0ecb09b1ea322ba6b61751ec1f2de928ed4470bba26f6
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 443dd69caf90fc989fce11cad506f144dddfdc0e85ceccd93bc8ea9bfc9a901f
